{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24581","headline":"洗竹 · 白居易","name":"洗竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"布衾寒拥颈，毡履温承足。\n独立冰池前，久看洗霜竹。\n先除老且病，次去纤而曲。\n剪弃犹可怜，琅玕十余束。\n青青复籊籊，颇异凡草木。\n依然若有情，回头语僮仆。\n小者截鱼竿，大者编茅屋。\n勿作篲与箕，而令粪土辱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24581.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24581","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}